    "globalConstraints": "- DoltLite is a file the exam opens, never a second truth (popmechanic/ultrapowers#764, boundary (3)): the app's store module `client/src/storeData.ts` gains no callback, no cell and no default, `client/src` is byte-identical to BASE, and the history package reads a store through `getContent()` and writes nothing into it. A callback added to the store module is a finding: the linter walks every exported function of that module as a move.\n- The oracle stays the comparison (popmechanic/ultrapowers#998, rule 4): a derived exam is a `stateExam` whose expected file was read back from a commit and whose mutant was read off a diff; no expected state and no mutant of a derived exam is typed by a person.\n- No commit hash is pinned anywhere \u2014 not in a test, not in a snapshot, not in a Context. Measured 2026-09-15 (`@dolthub/doltlite` 0.50.10, Bun 1.4.2): two recordings of the same session under the same `--date` yield different hashes, because the file's root commit `Initialize data repository` carries the file's creation time and every descendant hashes over it. A hash is read from the log and used in the same process; what is pinned is messages, counts and the content `at()` reads back.\n- Every file under `tests/state-exams/` calls `stateExam(` exactly once, at column 0, and calls nothing else exported by `tinyapp-exam` at its top level: `lint:state` reads every exam file in a child process with every export of `tinyapp-exam` but `stateExam` replaced by a no-op and every `bun:test` name too, so a top-level `diffContent(\u2026)` from `tinyapp-exam` returns `undefined` there and a file with no column-0 `stateExam(` is not counted by `packages/tinyapp-lint/test/lint-cli.test.ts`. Top-level calls into `packages/tinyapp-history` are fine: only the exam file's own imports are rewritten.\n- The linter's own tests under `packages/tinyapp-lint/test/` are loosened only by containment, never re-pinned to a new literal; a re-pinned count or list is a finding.\n- The exam files of this plan import the history package by relative path \u2014 `../../packages/tinyapp-history/src/<module>` from `tests/state-exams/` \u2014 never by the bare name `tinyapp-history`, which is linked into `node_modules` only by a `bun install` that has seen the new package.",
